```nginx
server {
  listen 80;
  server_name www.example.com example.com;
  return 301 https://example.com$request_uri;
}

# Single path
location = /old-page {
  return 301 /new-page;
}
```

```js
app.get('/old-page', (req, res) => {
  res.redirect(301, '/new-page'); // 301 = permanent
  // res.redirect(302, '/temp') would be temporary
});
```
